Flashcard Quiz V1

Features
- External flashcard documents
- Index of all flashcard sets
- Ability to add flashcard sets
- Flashcard quizzes with custom question numbers
- Quiz percentages and number correct
- All additions are saved externally
- Modular functions


Concepts Learned
- File input/output
- Multiple functions
- Dictionaries (initially)
- Randomness
- Program state
- Dynamic file creation
- Validation
- Simple software architecture

